    "id": "ctkg:v3e-canonical-63969b9b8258585d1a70c879",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "例如，对于传递函数为 G(s)=K/(s(s+2)(s+30)) 的系统，我们可以忽略极点 s=-30 的影响。但必须保持系统的稳态响应不变，因此将系统降阶为 G(s)=(K/30)/(s(s+2))。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "For example, if we have a system with transfer function G(s)=K/(s(s+2)(s+30)), we can safely neglect the impact of the pole at s=-30. However, we must retain the steady-state response of the system, so we reduce the system to G(s)=(K/30)/(s(s+2)).",
